s=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}(V)\\land\\left(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;V_n=\\bigcap_{i\\in\\mathbb N,\\;i\\le n}U_i\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;V_{n+1}\\subseteq V_n\\right)\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}V_n=\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}(V)\\land\\left(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;V_n=\\bigcap_{i\\in\\mathbb N,\\;i\\le n}U_i\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;V_{n+1}\\subseteq V_n\\right)\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}V_n=\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限交统一有效开；V_n⊆U_n保留测度界，且两列的全交相同。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$，$\\mathrm{MLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-mltest]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLTest}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}(V)\\land\\left(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;V_n=\\bigcap_{i\\in\\mathbb N,\\;i\\le n}U_i\